{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106310","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610631001:1":{"text":"니엘, 어제 초상화 복원 시험에서 무엇을 맡았죠?","source_cn":"尼尔，昨天在修复画像的考试时，你负责什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E3E9F9FF036DC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610631002:1":{"text":"저는 피파와 함께 초상화에 마력을 주입하는 일을 맡았어요. 하지만 교장 선생님 일이랑은 전혀 관련 없어요! 정말로요. 하늘에 맹세해요!","source_cn":"我和皮帕要一起给画像注入魔力，校长的死和我没关系！真的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D2C2666EE318858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610631003:1":{"text":"긴장하지 말고 사실대로만 답하면 돼요. 그때 어떤 마법을 썼죠? 그리고 마력을 잃은 이유는 뭐라고 생각하나요?","source_cn":"不要紧张，如实回答我的问题就好。你当时用了什么魔法，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x734D7C6BC7C99B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610631004:1":{"text":"그건...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog29>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77E10D7D8BEF0875","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610631005:1":{"text":"니엘, 시험 중에 교칙을 어긴 게 사실이라고 해도 “살인” 혐의보다는 훨씬 가벼울 거랍니다. 그러니 솔직하게 말하는 게 좋을 거예요.","source_cn":"尼尔，即使你在考试中使用了违规手段，也不会比“谋杀”的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0110CF8B6CDFB96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610631006:1":{"text":"그... 그게... 시험 전에 마력을 강화시켜 주는 <style=\"highlight\">특별 마법 계약</style>을 맺었어요...","source_cn":"我……我在考试前签订了一个<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x025C1F9FBFC7346C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610631007:1":{"text":"마법 계약? 구체적으로 어떤 계약이죠?","source_cn":"魔法契约？具体内容是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC47830E81941CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610631008:1":{"text":"...그게... <style=\"highlight\">마력을 끊임없이 증가</style>하게 만들어주는 계약인데... 급하게 많은 마력이 필요할 때 계약을 통해서 마력을 <style=\"highlight\">빌리는 거죠</style>...","source_cn":"……就是能够让我的<style=highlight>魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF4FBDD926506D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610631009:1":{"text":"계약을 맺은 뒤로 정말 마력이 점점 강해졌어요. 처음에는 그저 신기했죠. 아무것도 안 해도 마력이 계속 차오르니까요!","source_cn":"契约签过以后，我的魔力真的在慢慢增长。非常神奇，我什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3141B9559CF9054","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610631010:1":{"text":"이런 경우는 처음 보네요... 그럼 계약으로 빌린 마력은 갚아야 하나요?","source_cn":"奇怪，这很不正常……你从契约中借用的魔力是否需要偿还？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D0EBAB1D6AC8082","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610631011:1":{"text":"네. 계약상 한 달 뒤에 제 마력으로 갚아야 해요. 아... 물론, 빌렸던 것보다 조금 더 많이 갚아야 하지만요.","source_cn":"是的，需要偿还。在借用魔力一个月后，我会被契约抽取魔力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D13405D7F4E163E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610631012:1":{"text":"음... 은행 대출이랑 같군요. 이자가 붙는 셈이네요.","source_cn":"嗯……和银行贷款一样，也需要收取利息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CAE81994DC3562E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610631013:1":{"text":"그럼 그 계약은 누구랑 맺은 거죠?","source_cn":"和你签订契约是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC1302E91E50A446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610631014:1":{"text":"화려한 옷차림에 부자처럼 보이는 남자였어요. 이름이... 이름이... 그러니까... 으윽...!","source_cn":"是个穿着华丽服装，看上去很有钱的男士，他叫……叫……他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CF84CAC48728D8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"이브","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尼尔":{"text":"니엘","source":"尼尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}